Package: plink4r
Type: Package
Title: Genotype and Summary-Statistics Imputation from Eigen LD Blocks
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R: person("Yihe", "Yang", email = "yxy1234@case.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads PLINK BED / PGEN genotypes with the bundled pgenlib into a compact 2-bit + int16 store
    (geno_open) with its cross products, appended columns and correlations, and imputes missing genotype cells
    and missing GWAS summary statistics from blockwise eigen LD (SBayesRC or plink4r eigen.bin layout),
    with OpenMP parallelism. Summary-statistics imputation is ported from SBayesRC.QC2.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: data.table, arrow, Rcpp, stats, utils
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppEigen
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: GNU make
